                                                "sense_id": "cdd76976-ef79-38b1-bf56-68da4da13b51",
                                                "text": "But then the ore of Lempſter / By Got is never a Sempſter; / That when he is ſpun, ore did, / Yet match him with hir thrid"
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    }
